## Model card

- **Name:** GLM 5.3 Flash
- **Short description:** Z.ai’s 320B/18B-active Flash MoE for ultra-fast agentic coding. Per meta.json short description: “ultra-fast agentic coding from Z.ai’s Flash MoE — MIT weights, 1M context, and a track record of previewing anonymously at the top of blind coding arenas.” No verified public release date or knowledge cutoff confirmed.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/glm-5.3-flash` via `https://opencode.ai/inference/openai/v1/chat/completions`; official site https://open.zhipuai.cn/. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** no verified public release date found; knowledge cutoff not publicly documented.
- **IDs:** opencode/glm-5.3-flash
- **Context window:** 204K per meta.json `contextWindow`. Meta short description mentions 1M context; no verified public measurement found for the Flash SKU.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out per meta.json `modalities`.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** OpenCode Console pricing $0.15 / 1M input, $0.50 / 1M output, $0.03 / 1M cached read. meta.json notes “Free Zen tier available”.
- **Architecture:** 320B total / 18B active MoE per meta short description; weights described as MIT in meta short description. No verified public architecture sheet found.

